                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Report by the Deputies</hi></p>
                <p>This Report was submitted by the Chairman in office and adopted.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Peace Treaty With
                        Italy</hi>: C.F.M.(D) (46) 177<anchor n="53" xml:id="d182-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Restitution</hi> (Appendix
                        II<anchor n="54" xml:id="d182-f2"/>)</p>
                <p>In the text proposed in paragraph 1 of Part II the Council agreed to insert after
                    the words “by force” the words “or duress” as proposed in sub-paragraph (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">a</hi>).</p>
                <p>Paragraph 1 of Part III, dealing with the burden of proof, was referred back to
                    the Economic Experts for study.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Economic and Financial Provisions
                        Relating to Ceded Territories</hi> (Appendix VI)<anchor n="55"
                        xml:id="d182-f3"/></p>
                <p>Part I of this Appendix was adopted, subject to the reservations specified
                    therein.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">IV. <hi rendition="#italic">General Economic Clauses</hi>
                    (Appendix IV)<anchor n="56" xml:id="d182-f4"/></p>
                <p>The Council discussed Part II of this Appendix. No agreement was reached.</p>
                <pb facs="0569" n="547" xml:id="pg547"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">V. <hi rendition="#italic">Personal Injuries</hi> (Art.
                    66)</p>
                <p>To be discussed later by the Council of Foreign Ministers.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">VI. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>It was agreed to hold the next meeting of the Council at 11 a.m. on Thursday,
                    20th June.</p>
